The Following is a list of ToolTypes for this ICON:


NOTICE: ALL TOOLTYPES ARE CASE SENSITIVE


NOTICE: This ICON tooltypes specify the access defaults assigned to a users
        account when he/she logs on.

        %References: ACS.DEF.HLP



ACS.ACCOUNT_EDITING
ACS.COMMENT_TO_SYSOP
ACS.DOWNLOAD
ACS.ENTER_MESSAGE
ACS.FILE_LISTINGS
ACS.JOIN_CONFERENCE
ACS.NEW_FILES_SINCE
ACS.PAGE_SYSOP
ACS.READ_MESSAGE
ACS.DISPLAY_USER_STATS
ACS.UPLOAD
ACS.VIEW_A_FILE
ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO
ACS.REMOTE_SHELL
ACS.ZIPPY_TEXT_SEARCH
ACS.OVERIDE_CHAT
ACS.EDIT_USER_NAME
ACS.EDIT_USER_LOCATION
ACS.EDIT_USER_PHONE_NUMBER
ACS.EDIT_PASSWORD
ACS.OVERIDE_TIMES
ACS.SYSOP_READ
ACS.EALL_MESSAGES


ACS.ACCOUNT_EDITING

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Gives Access to Account Editing

     ACS.ACCOUNT_EDITING

ACS.COMMENT_TO_SYSOP

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to leave a comment to the sysop

     ACS.COMMENT_TO_SYSOP

ACS.DOWNLOAD

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to download files.

     ACS.DOWNLOAD

ACS.ENTER_MESSAGE

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to enter a message.

     ACS.ENTER_MESSAGE

ACS.FILE_LISTINGS

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to view catalog of available files.

     ACS.FILE_LISTINGS

ACS.JOIN_CONFERENCE

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to Join a Conference.

     ACS.JOIN_CONFERENCE

ACS.NEW_FILES_SINCE

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to list recent catalog entries.

ACS.PAGE_SYSOP

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to page the sysop.
         -If the sysop page flag on express is turned off then the user will
          be notified that you are not available.

     ACS.PAGE_SYSOP


ACS.READ_MESSAGE

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to read messages

     ACS.READ_MESSAGE


ACS.DISPLAY_USER_STATS

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to view his/her status on the system.

     ACS.DISPLAY_USER_STATS


ACS.UPLOAD

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to upload files.

     ACS.UPLOAD


ACS.VIEW_A_FILE

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to view downloadable text files.

     ACS.VIEW_A_FILE


ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows a user to edit his/her account.

     ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO


ACS.REMOTE_SHELL

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to gain access to the Remote Shell.

     ACS.REMOTE_SHELL

         %References: NODE.HLP


ACS.ZIPPY_TEXT_SEARCH

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to search the catalog for key items with the online
          search features of /X.

     ACS.ZIPPY_TEXT_SEARCH


ACS.OVERIDE_CHAT

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to OverRide the /X chat flag and successfully page the
          sysop.

     ACS.OVERIDE_CHAT


ACS.EDIT_USER_NAME

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to change his/her handle.

     ACS.EDIT_USER_NAME

         %References: ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO


ACS.EDIT_USER_LOCATION

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to change his/her location

     ACS.EDIT_USER_LOCATION

         %References: ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO


ACS.EDIT_PHONE_NUMBER

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to change his/her phone number

     ACS.EDIT_PHONE_NUMBER

         %References: ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO


ACS.EDIT_PASSWORD

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to change his/her password.

     ACS.EDIT_PASSWORD

         %References: ACS.EDIT_USER_INFO


ACS.OVERIDE_TIMES

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to bypass the time restrictions placed on a Node.

     ACS.OVERIDE_TIMES

         %References: TIMES.XXXX.DEF


ACS.SYSOP_READ

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to read mail, regardless of whose it is ;)

     ACS.SYSOP_READ


ACS.EALL_MESSAGES

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -Allows user to enter PRIVATE MAIL to ALL users of the current
          conference at 1 time.

     ACS.EALL_MESSAGES

